(2262983, 312195, 47117, '<td valign="top">The sky is rather flat, unfortunately. I have that problem a LOT myself. Wouldn''t it be glorious to get the skys we want when we want them? LOL...I can see that the greens in the middle of the shot would have been nice, if there wasn''t so much shadow, and the water also has too much shadow. I would like to see this shot done again, but at a different time of the day.  I think that is really the only problem with this shot - wrong time of day.</td>', 'The sky is rather flat, unfortunately. I have that problem a LOT myself. Wouldn''t it be glorious to get the skys we want when we want them? LOL...I can see that the greens in the middle of the shot would have been nice, if there wasn''t so much shadow, and the water also has too much shadow. I would like to see this shot done again, but at a different time of the day.  I think that is really the only problem with this shot - wrong time of day.', '2006-03-27 08:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2262987, 312139, 47117, '<td valign="top">I think the image from the water drop is amazing and a one of a time capture if it formed that way naturally, but I am concerned a little bit about the glass penquin. It looks placed there in PS and not realistic to the shot.  Very creative though!</td>', 'I think the image from the water drop is amazing and a one of a time capture if it formed that way naturally, but I am concerned a little bit about the glass penquin. It looks placed there in PS and not realistic to the shot.  Very creative though!', '2006-03-27 08:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
