(2263092, 311570, 47117, '<td valign="top">OH MY LAWD! I was working on about 20 photos I took just yesterday of Koi. It is Koi by the way, and not Kio. I almost entered a very similar shot! WHEW!!  I will have some in my prints shortly, but wow, I was so amazed to see this. As I was voting along, I saw no Koi. I thought I should have entered it. Aside from my Koi, I had about 16 other different water shots too choose from and gave up at about 9:30 last night on choices and just entered one I liked and threw my hands up in the air. LOL...I had three Koi just like this, but with mouths open. I was going to call it "The Three Tenors". LOL...Anyway, nice shot and love the composition. :)</td>', 'OH MY LAWD! I was working on about 20 photos I took just yesterday of Koi. It is Koi by the way, and not Kio. I almost entered a very similar shot! WHEW!!  I will have some in my prints shortly, but wow, I was so amazed to see this. As I was voting along, I saw no Koi. I thought I should have entered it. Aside from my Koi, I had about 16 other different water shots too choose from and gave up at about 9:30 last night on choices and just entered one I liked and threw my hands up in the air. LOL...I had three Koi just like this, but with mouths open. I was going to call it "The Three Tenors". LOL...Anyway, nice shot and love the composition. :)', '2006-03-27 09:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
