(2263702, 311777, 14476, '<td valign="top">Oh;, these are so much fun to photograph.  I like the stop action very much, but wonder if the composition would have been improved with an uncentered crop.  Say by cropping quite a bit off the left side, leaving the excellent detail and lovely blue sky to the right.  Obviously, just my opinion...</td>', 'Oh;, these are so much fun to photograph.  I like the stop action very much, but wonder if the composition would have been improved with an uncentered crop.  Say by cropping quite a bit off the left side, leaving the excellent detail and lovely blue sky to the right.  Obviously, just my opinion...', '2006-03-27 13:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2263703, 311570, 14476, '<td valign="top">And healthy ones they are too!  There''s a bit of reflection to the right that (if it was mine) I''d probably try to crop out or dull down a bit.  But it''s a good one and those koi are beautifully exposed.</td>', 'And healthy ones they are too!  There''s a bit of reflection to the right that (if it was mine) I''d probably try to crop out or dull down a bit.  But it''s a good one and those koi are beautifully exposed.', '2006-03-27 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
