(2264058, 310985, 50674, '<td valign="top">Exquisite shot, fabulous colours, good balance, good composition</td>', 'Exquisite shot, fabulous colours, good balance, good composition', '2006-03-27 15:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264060, 312037, 50674, '<td valign="top">Good work you''ve done, shot and processing. I like the difference between the lithe flowing wonderfully coloured water and then the rest that, compared to the water, looks so messy. Well done.</td>', 'Good work you''ve done, shot and processing. I like the difference between the lithe flowing wonderfully coloured water and then the rest that, compared to the water, looks so messy. Well done.', '2006-03-27 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264063, 311174, 31133, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and that oh-so-serious look! Awesome cropping. On a personal level, I bet she can give the worlds toughest look when she''s mad :-) Very, very nice job.</td>', 'Love the colors and that oh-so-serious look! Awesome cropping. On a personal level, I bet she can give the worlds toughest look when she''s mad :-) Very, very nice job.', '2006-03-27 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264068, 310115, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wow, either Sweden or Denmark? Nice colors. The two major elements, boat and rock, sort of compete with each other for my attention, but maybe your intention is that they should balance each other. I think I prefer the boat on it''s own, but that''s just my taste. It''s lovely and rusty and full of character.</td>', 'Wow, either Sweden or Denmark? Nice colors. The two major elements, boat and rock, sort of compete with each other for my attention, but maybe your intention is that they should balance each other. I think I prefer the boat on it''s own, but that''s just my taste. It''s lovely and rusty and full of character.', '2006-03-27 15:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264075, 312112, 31133, '<td valign="top">The reflection and position of this heron is nice. I like that there''s nothing too complicated about the composition. Not sure if you meant for it to be grainy or have jpg artifacts (not sure what it is)... that''s a slight drawback for my taste. Nice effort.</td>', 'The reflection and position of this heron is nice. I like that there''s nothing too complicated about the composition. Not sure if you meant for it to be grainy or have jpg artifacts (not sure what it is)... that''s a slight drawback for my taste. Nice effort.', '2006-03-27 15:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264084, 312154, 31133, '<td valign="top">The water in the fountain is beautiful, really just perfect. The top part of the composition with the dark sculpture and the competing light, bring this down a bit for me. Love that fountain and water, though!</td>', 'The water in the fountain is beautiful, really just perfect. The top part of the composition with the dark sculpture and the competing light, bring this down a bit for me. Love that fountain and water, though!', '2006-03-27 16:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264092, 311974, 31133, '<td valign="top">The symmetry with the water coming out of the duck''s beak is pretty cool. I like how the duck is just entering the shot from the right. Only criticism is I wouldn''t mind seeing it just a tad sharper on the duck itself. The focus seems to be right on the edge of the beak. Great colors.</td>', 'The symmetry with the water coming out of the duck''s beak is pretty cool. I like how the duck is just entering the shot from the right. Only criticism is I wouldn''t mind seeing it just a tad sharper on the duck itself. The focus seems to be right on the edge of the beak. Great colors.', '2006-03-27 16:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2264099, 312038, 51900, '<td valign="top">sry, but it''s been done way to many times</td>', 'sry, but it''s been done way to many times', '2006-03-27 16:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
