(2265380, 312218, 51293, '<td valign="top">Maybe close your ap some next time to get all pools in focus.  May have a better impact.  I like this idea and photo overall though.</td>', 'Maybe close your ap some next time to get all pools in focus.  May have a better impact.  I like this idea and photo overall though.', '2006-03-28 00:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
