(2265391, 311528, 51293, '<td valign="top">I love your lighting here.  And the one droplet of water coming from the rusty old faucet is nicely done.</td>', 'I love your lighting here.  And the one droplet of water coming from the rusty old faucet is nicely done.', '2006-03-28 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265395, 311373, 13688, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and focus.  i find it odd that you have chosen to leave in the other flowers as they seem to clutter the composition and take away from your sadness angle.</td>', 'excellent lighting and focus.  i find it odd that you have chosen to leave in the other flowers as they seem to clutter the composition and take away from your sadness angle.', '2006-03-28 00:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265398, 310985, 53892, '<td valign="top">This is a neat picture. Is it my eyes, or is that water dirty?</td>', 'This is a neat picture. Is it my eyes, or is that water dirty?', '2006-03-28 00:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265400, 311525, 51293, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  It almost doesn''t look "real" lol...It reminds me of a technique in photoshop used to make life sized subjects (typically landscape...houses, and such) appear to be models.  Anyway, this is quite lovely.</td>', 'I really like this.  It almost doesn''t look "real" lol...It reminds me of a technique in photoshop used to make life sized subjects (typically landscape...houses, and such) appear to be models.  Anyway, this is quite lovely.', '2006-03-28 00:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265401, 312212, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice find.  i wish both guys had more enthusiastic body positionings...i just can''t see how they wouldn''t with a 15'' wave crashing down behind them.</td>', 'nice find.  i wish both guys had more enthusiastic body positionings...i just can''t see how they wouldn''t with a 15'' wave crashing down behind them.', '2006-03-28 00:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265405, 311169, 53892, '<td valign="top">Is this Miami again? I really love the color of the water</td>', 'Is this Miami again? I really love the color of the water', '2006-03-28 00:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265406, 312193, 51293, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t quite grabbing me.  It feels like it''s missing a focal point.  Perhaps if you got rid of the plant life on the bottom right corner...maybe moved up some in the brook...used a longer exposure to really get the movement of the water?  Just some ideas.  Looks like a lovely place to shoot however.</td>', 'This just isn''t quite grabbing me.  It feels like it''s missing a focal point.  Perhaps if you got rid of the plant life on the bottom right corner...maybe moved up some in the brook...used a longer exposure to really get the movement of the water?  Just some ideas.  Looks like a lovely place to shoot however.', '2006-03-28 00:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265409, 310087, 51293, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a truly stunning image.  Just amazing clarity and emotion.  I really hope this one ribbons.</td>', 'Wow, what a truly stunning image.  Just amazing clarity and emotion.  I really hope this one ribbons.', '2006-03-28 00:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265410, 312172, 15568, '<td valign="top">powerful</td>', 'powerful', '2006-03-28 00:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265411, 311436, 51293, '<td valign="top">I see the subject in this as the pinecone, not of water.  It could stand to be a bit sharper as well.</td>', 'I see the subject in this as the pinecone, not of water.  It could stand to be a bit sharper as well.', '2006-03-28 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265417, 311576, 51293, '<td valign="top">Straighten out the horizon, and you''ll have a great image.</td>', 'Straighten out the horizon, and you''ll have a great image.', '2006-03-28 01:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265422, 312142, 13688, '<td valign="top">tough shot with the bright sunlight. you almost had to zoom in and concentrate the composition on just the falls. if you still had the ability to stop down a bunch of stops or could have thrown an nd filter or 2 on, then possibly used photoshop to brighten back the water post process, i think it would have really strengthened the shot</td>', 'tough shot with the bright sunlight. you almost had to zoom in and concentrate the composition on just the falls. if you still had the ability to stop down a bunch of stops or could have thrown an nd filter or 2 on, then possibly used photoshop to brighten back the water post process, i think it would have really strengthened the shot', '2006-03-28 01:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265424, 311921, 4767, '<td valign="top">Well planned, very dramatic and creative.</td>', 'Well planned, very dramatic and creative.', '2006-03-28 01:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265426, 312069, 4767, '<td valign="top">in Murray?</td>', 'in Murray?', '2006-03-28 01:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265431, 311560, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice textures and colors.  i wish there was a bit more room around the edges</td>', 'nice textures and colors.  i wish there was a bit more room around the edges', '2006-03-28 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265437, 310854, 13688, '<td valign="top">i think the composition is fantastic how the bg boats are leaning into the foreground.  i like the sun as part of the frame but i''m not sure about how it has come out after processing.  oddly the blues seem over saturated but the water doesn''t.  It looks like it could have been a very cool light green, but seems to have been lost.</td>', 'i think the composition is fantastic how the bg boats are leaning into the foreground.  i like the sun as part of the frame but i''m not sure about how it has come out after processing.  oddly the blues seem over saturated but the water doesn''t.  It looks like it could have been a very cool light green, but seems to have been lost.', '2006-03-28 01:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265440, 311378, 13688, '<td valign="top">fish looks grumpy, or scared out of his mind...i guess that depended on the number of times the glass had to be emptied and refilled.  either way well posed capture.</td>', 'fish looks grumpy, or scared out of his mind...i guess that depended on the number of times the glass had to be emptied and refilled.  either way well posed capture.', '2006-03-28 01:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265444, 310725, 13688, '<td valign="top">very peaceful.  since their isn''t alot of colors i wonder what this would have looked like b/w with a little boost in contrast.  why did you duplicate the bottom piece of foam?  it looks kind of unnatural</td>', 'very peaceful.  since their isn''t alot of colors i wonder what this would have looked like b/w with a little boost in contrast.  why did you duplicate the bottom piece of foam?  it looks kind of unnatural', '2006-03-28 01:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2265449, 312069, 13688, '<td valign="top">clean and crisp.  the figure on the bridge would have been good for "Where''s Waldo"</td>', 'clean and crisp.  the figure on the bridge would have been good for "Where''s Waldo"', '2006-03-28 01:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
