(2265691, 312146, 55773, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t be surprised if this takes the blue!<br/>There are some amazing tonal ranges in this image, but i can''t help to wonder what it would have looked like in colour. 9</td>', 'I wouldn''t be surprised if this takes the blue!There are some amazing tonal ranges in this image, but i can''t help to wonder what it would have looked like in colour. 9', '2006-03-28 05:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
