(2267210, 311876, 35994, '<td valign="top">Like the shot, the detail of the foam in the wave looks good. Might''ve like to see it in color but it looks like it might''ve turned out dull looking if it was cloudy. - 7</td>', 'Like the shot, the detail of the foam in the wave looks good. Might''ve like to see it in color but it looks like it might''ve turned out dull looking if it was cloudy. - 7', '2006-03-28 18:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
