(2267579, 310757, 53571, '<td valign="top">I like the texture in this photograph. I would like to see it sharper however.</td>', 'I like the texture in this photograph. I would like to see it sharper however.', '2006-03-28 21:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267581, 312140, 53571, '<td valign="top">This is a special moment you have captured here. I would like to see this with a smaller depth of field. I feel the background is slightly distracting.</td>', 'This is a special moment you have captured here. I would like to see this with a smaller depth of field. I feel the background is slightly distracting.', '2006-03-28 21:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267583, 311169, 53571, '<td valign="top">I love this image. It is very well exposed. I would like to see you try a lower shooting angle to try to get more of the figure''s reflection in the composition. I feel like this would be a stronger image then it already is with that addition.</td>', 'I love this image. It is very well exposed. I would like to see you try a lower shooting angle to try to get more of the figure''s reflection in the composition. I feel like this would be a stronger image then it already is with that addition.', '2006-03-28 21:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267587, 311780, 53571, '<td valign="top">Good idea. It is a little gray for my tastes. Also, I feel that the drop itself could be sharper. Maybe next time try a higher shooting angle? More water and less background.</td>', 'Good idea. It is a little gray for my tastes. Also, I feel that the drop itself could be sharper. Maybe next time try a higher shooting angle? More water and less background.', '2006-03-28 21:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267590, 311869, 53571, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. I think the extreme depth of field works in this shot. I might suggest composing the shot in such a way as to attempt to put something recognizable in the reflection.</td>', 'I like this shot. I think the extreme depth of field works in this shot. I might suggest composing the shot in such a way as to attempt to put something recognizable in the reflection.', '2006-03-28 21:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267595, 312052, 53571, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I feel the light could be slightly better and you could crop the image, either in the camera or post production to draw our attention to the real strengths of the photo: the car, reflection, and reflection of the sky.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I feel the light could be slightly better and you could crop the image, either in the camera or post production to draw our attention to the real strengths of the photo: the car, reflection, and reflection of the sky.', '2006-03-28 21:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267598, 311647, 53571, '<td valign="top">Nice moment. I would like to see what this shot would have looked like 1/250 of a second earlier.</td>', 'Nice moment. I would like to see what this shot would have looked like 1/250 of a second earlier.', '2006-03-28 21:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267599, 312038, 53571, '<td valign="top">This is a special shot for me. The only suggestion I might have is that I feel the image is a little dark near the top. Otherwise, excellent job.</td>', 'This is a special shot for me. The only suggestion I might have is that I feel the image is a little dark near the top. Otherwise, excellent job.', '2006-03-28 21:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267603, 311343, 53571, '<td valign="top">I feel this shot could use a few changes. First I feel that it is about 1/2 a stop overexposed (hot spots in the apple). Second, I feel the image could be sharper. It feels blurry to me.</td>', 'I feel this shot could use a few changes. First I feel that it is about 1/2 a stop overexposed (hot spots in the apple). Second, I feel the image could be sharper. It feels blurry to me.', '2006-03-28 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267608, 311517, 53571, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I have two suggestions. I feel this image could be slightly sharper. Secondly I would like there to be some sort of focus to the composition. It feels like there isn''t a main focus in the image. I think there is more you could do with the reflection.</td>', 'Nice image. I have two suggestions. I feel this image could be slightly sharper. Secondly I would like there to be some sort of focus to the composition. It feels like there isn''t a main focus in the image. I think there is more you could do with the reflection.', '2006-03-28 21:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267609, 312079, 53571, '<td valign="top">I feel this image is simply to abstract for me to have an opinion on. I feel the image could be sharper however.</td>', 'I feel this image is simply to abstract for me to have an opinion on. I feel the image could be sharper however.', '2006-03-28 21:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267613, 311694, 53571, '<td valign="top">I feel that this image is overproduced. I think you have a distinctive image without the selective color.</td>', 'I feel that this image is overproduced. I think you have a distinctive image without the selective color.', '2006-03-28 21:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267615, 312082, 53571, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the focus of this photograph is to far away to be interesting. The texture of the water isn''t enough to carry the frame. It also may be slightly gray and underexposed.</td>', 'In my opinion the focus of this photograph is to far away to be interesting. The texture of the water isn''t enough to carry the frame. It also may be slightly gray and underexposed.', '2006-03-28 21:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267617, 311945, 53571, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for this type of grandiose landscape. Very nicely done.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for this type of grandiose landscape. Very nicely done.', '2006-03-28 21:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267620, 309338, 53571, '<td valign="top">I love the abstract pattern that emerges on the lower middle quadrant of the photo. I do not think the long exposure does anything for the image. I would rather see one drop that is delicately captured rather than what you have done here.</td>', 'I love the abstract pattern that emerges on the lower middle quadrant of the photo. I do not think the long exposure does anything for the image. I would rather see one drop that is delicately captured rather than what you have done here.', '2006-03-28 21:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267624, 311433, 53571, '<td valign="top">I love the upper quadrant of the photograph. The clouds are wonderful. However, the image really falls apart in the water. The water is too busy to have the beautiful reflection this shot is begging for. The sun flare is very distracting.</td>', 'I love the upper quadrant of the photograph. The clouds are wonderful. However, the image really falls apart in the water. The water is too busy to have the beautiful reflection this shot is begging for. The sun flare is very distracting.', '2006-03-28 21:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267628, 310732, 53571, '<td valign="top">These types of shots can be very beautiful. I love the areas of the shot that are in focus. In my opinion, "windshield" shots like this need more care and craft. I might recommend a tripod in the future to allow longer exposures, lower f stops and more areas in focus.</td>', 'These types of shots can be very beautiful. I love the areas of the shot that are in focus. In my opinion, "windshield" shots like this need more care and craft. I might recommend a tripod in the future to allow longer exposures, lower f stops and more areas in focus.', '2006-03-28 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267632, 310659, 53571, '<td valign="top">The water is wonderful. I feel the color balance many be a bit on the yellow side.</td>', 'The water is wonderful. I feel the color balance many be a bit on the yellow side.', '2006-03-28 21:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2267636, 311842, 53571, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful image. All four corners are dark. Intentional?</td>', 'This is a wonderful image. All four corners are dark. Intentional?', '2006-03-28 21:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
