(2269538, 311960, 38549, '<td valign="top">this looks over sharpend, the composition is different since you stood behind the trees, and the water is way blown out.</td>', 'this looks over sharpend, the composition is different since you stood behind the trees, and the water is way blown out.', '2006-03-29 10:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269548, 312108, 38549, '<td valign="top">this would be a better shot if there wasnt a big finger print smear along the rim, and then you can see the shadow and the ring below the bowl of the glass is really blown out, <br/>just to add, it would have been cool if you took a mirror and used it to work up the beta so that he would be all swolen and in defensive mode,</td>', 'this would be a better shot if there wasnt a big finger print smear along the rim, and then you can see the shadow and the ring below the bowl of the glass is really blown out, just to add, it would have been cool if you took a mirror and used it to work up the beta so that he would be all swolen and in defensive mode,', '2006-03-29 11:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269563, 311876, 6008, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed was the shape and pattern in the nearest tide ebb. It appears to have movement and that helps give the image a little more energy and interest. The black and white conversion looks a little dull and flat on my monitor. I almost feel like you could have recropped it to not include the horizon/sky in order to put more emphasis on the contrast between wave and beach as that is where all the interest is within the image.</td>', 'The first thing I noticed was the shape and pattern in the nearest tide ebb. It appears to have movement and that helps give the image a little more energy and interest. The black and white conversion looks a little dull and flat on my monitor. I almost feel like you could have recropped it to not include the horizon/sky in order to put more emphasis on the contrast between wave and beach as that is where all the interest is within the image.', '2006-03-29 11:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269570, 311343, 53095, '<td valign="top">Looks oversaturated</td>', 'Looks oversaturated', '2006-03-29 11:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269578, 312094, 53095, '<td valign="top">It''s a good thing you have a descriptive title, otherwise I''d never know what this is.</td>', 'It''s a good thing you have a descriptive title, otherwise I''d never know what this is.', '2006-03-29 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269587, 311614, 53095, '<td valign="top">The leaves in the foreground are rather distracting</td>', 'The leaves in the foreground are rather distracting', '2006-03-29 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269591, 312007, 35545, '<td valign="top">I love crew shots.  I just wish you had gotten the whole shell in the picture.  If possible, I would have framed it differently -- less bridge, more shell.</td>', 'I love crew shots.  I just wish you had gotten the whole shell in the picture.  If possible, I would have framed it differently -- less bridge, more shell.', '2006-03-29 11:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269595, 311843, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m viewing this as product photography. The concept is good and has interest, energy, and color - all good with advertising. I''m not sure if it''s the type of text on the bottle but it almost seems blurry. If that is the product you''re trying to sell then that has to be the sharpest/strongest part of the image, unfortunately that doesnt seem to be the case here. Overall the concept and impact is good, but the execution could do with some work.</td>', 'I''m viewing this as product photography. The concept is good and has interest, energy, and color - all good with advertising. I''m not sure if it''s the type of text on the bottle but it almost seems blurry. If that is the product you''re trying to sell then that has to be the sharpest/strongest part of the image, unfortunately that doesnt seem to be the case here. Overall the concept and impact is good, but the execution could do with some work.', '2006-03-29 11:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269607, 309338, 6008, '<td valign="top">There doesnt seem to be a specific focal point and so my eyes wander around the image and my interest isnt really held. The idea is good but you need to isolate something more so that it becomes the focal point - whether it be form, movement, color, or light.</td>', 'There doesnt seem to be a specific focal point and so my eyes wander around the image and my interest isnt really held. The idea is good but you need to isolate something more so that it becomes the focal point - whether it be form, movement, color, or light.', '2006-03-29 11:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269610, 311969, 53095, '<td valign="top">The bridge/horizon looks underexposed.</td>', 'The bridge/horizon looks underexposed.', '2006-03-29 11:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269614, 311985, 53095, '<td valign="top">The top highlight is out of focus, otherwise this would be a stellar shot.</td>', 'The top highlight is out of focus, otherwise this would be a stellar shot.', '2006-03-29 11:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269617, 312247, 6008, '<td valign="top">A classic image. Great symmetry and reflection. The slight curve of the shoreline gives the impression of a slight unevenness, but it''s hardly a distraction. Should score well.</td>', 'A classic image. Great symmetry and reflection. The slight curve of the shoreline gives the impression of a slight unevenness, but it''s hardly a distraction. Should score well.', '2006-03-29 11:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269623, 311832, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming this is infra-red, if not, then you succeeded in emulating that feel/style. I like the use of leading lines to get the eye to the trees. It almost looks like an alternative surreal world. Very pretty and appealing to the eye. The blue is an excellent contrast to the white.</td>', 'I''m assuming this is infra-red, if not, then you succeeded in emulating that feel/style. I like the use of leading lines to get the eye to the trees. It almost looks like an alternative surreal world. Very pretty and appealing to the eye. The blue is an excellent contrast to the white.', '2006-03-29 11:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269625, 311494, 54539, '<td valign="top">great photo!!!</td>', 'great photo!!!', '2006-03-29 11:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269641, 309334, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a somewhat difficult photograph to judge. Technically it isnt great, but it has a level of difficulty and a visual impact. The contrast seems very low and there also appears to be an abundance of water spots. The way the crop ''amputates'' her legs is also a little disturbing. I think the image has potential, but maybe a few adjustments in post-processing to bring out more of the impact.</td>', 'This is a somewhat difficult photograph to judge. Technically it isnt great, but it has a level of difficulty and a visual impact. The contrast seems very low and there also appears to be an abundance of water spots. The way the crop ''amputates'' her legs is also a little disturbing. I think the image has potential, but maybe a few adjustments in post-processing to bring out more of the impact.', '2006-03-29 11:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269648, 312219, 6008, '<td valign="top">The selective desaturation works really well here. Even the telephone lines add to the urban feeling of the image instead of being the usual distraction. I like it!</td>', 'The selective desaturation works really well here. Even the telephone lines add to the urban feeling of the image instead of being the usual distraction. I like it!', '2006-03-29 11:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269670, 309339, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a view! The colors are very complimentary (thank you nature). I like the inclusion of foreground/middleground/background. At first I thought the birds were too small and a bit of a distraction but then I saw them as just another part of the vastness that this image seems to project. A very tranquil and soothing image.</td>', 'Wow, what a view! The colors are very complimentary (thank you nature). I like the inclusion of foreground/middleground/background. At first I thought the birds were too small and a bit of a distraction but then I saw them as just another part of the vastness that this image seems to project. A very tranquil and soothing image.', '2006-03-29 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269749, 312037, 29949, '<td valign="top">Amaizing pic! But i do not like the border......8</td>', 'Amaizing pic! But i do not like the border......8', '2006-03-29 12:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269753, 309339, 29949, '<td valign="top">I like these blue colours.</td>', 'I like these blue colours.', '2006-03-29 12:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269762, 311443, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photojournalistic shot. The body language of the boys, especially the one looking at the guy watering really help tell the story. Clarity and composition is good.</td>', 'This is an interesting photojournalistic shot. The body language of the boys, especially the one looking at the guy watering really help tell the story. Clarity and composition is good.', '2006-03-29 12:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269769, 311803, 6008, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The composition is good, the eye flows nicely around the image. The green of the moss is lush and vibrant. The only thing I would have liked to see is more contrast as the whole image is very light on my monitor.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The composition is good, the eye flows nicely around the image. The green of the moss is lush and vibrant. The only thing I would have liked to see is more contrast as the whole image is very light on my monitor.', '2006-03-29 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269770, 310998, 53095, '<td valign="top">looks a little dark to me, and the colo balance looks too red/pink</td>', 'looks a little dark to me, and the colo balance looks too red/pink', '2006-03-29 12:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269772, 312062, 29949, '<td valign="top">Hey!It''s Al Pacino!.....laughing too much here great shot.9</td>', 'Hey!It''s Al Pacino!.....laughing too much here great shot.9', '2006-03-29 12:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269773, 311960, 53095, '<td valign="top">That water is waaaay too washed out.</td>', 'That water is waaaay too washed out.', '2006-03-29 12:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269778, 311888, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good closeup with nice saturation of the orange beak and no blown highlights on the goose. The white blur in the top right corner is very distracting. The color of the water is also not very appealing. A selective desaturation, black/white conversion, or even a sepia tone may have balanced the image.</td>', 'Good closeup with nice saturation of the orange beak and no blown highlights on the goose. The white blur in the top right corner is very distracting. The color of the water is also not very appealing. A selective desaturation, black/white conversion, or even a sepia tone may have balanced the image.', '2006-03-29 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269782, 311851, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with good detail.</td>', 'Nice shot with good detail.', '2006-03-29 12:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269794, 311896, 6008, '<td valign="top">A nicely clean image appropriately toned to represent water. The tilt of the glass is a little distracting, as is the shadow. Another angle may have been more appealing. The water on the sides of the glass look like remnants of a previous attempt since they arent connected with the current pouring. It''s time consuming but drying the glass between attempts gives the image a more aesthetic/clean appeal, especially for use with product photography.</td>', 'A nicely clean image appropriately toned to represent water. The tilt of the glass is a little distracting, as is the shadow. Another angle may have been more appealing. The water on the sides of the glass look like remnants of a previous attempt since they arent connected with the current pouring. It''s time consuming but drying the glass between attempts gives the image a more aesthetic/clean appeal, especially for use with product photography.', '2006-03-29 12:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269800, 310656, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea and I like the composition but the noise and lack of focus makes the image less than appealing.</td>', 'It''s a good idea and I like the composition but the noise and lack of focus makes the image less than appealing.', '2006-03-29 12:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269809, 311895, 53095, '<td valign="top">hahaha...very funny</td>', 'hahaha...very funny', '2006-03-29 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269815, 312095, 53095, '<td valign="top">Too noisy.</td>', 'Too noisy.', '2006-03-29 12:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269823, 311487, 6008, '<td valign="top">The highlights on the water are the focal point of the image since they are the brightest parts. I like the circular ripples. The actual drops are almost pointless since they do not stand out in the image at all. On second thoughts if you crop just below the falling drop, eliminating it and the diagonal line the composition changes completely and the focus is put back on the splash.</td>', 'The highlights on the water are the focal point of the image since they are the brightest parts. I like the circular ripples. The actual drops are almost pointless since they do not stand out in the image at all. On second thoughts if you crop just below the falling drop, eliminating it and the diagonal line the composition changes completely and the focus is put back on the splash.', '2006-03-29 12:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269831, 312195, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sky is the brightest part of the image and so that is where my eye goes first. In contrast the grass and trees are very dark. To me this image has significant exposure issues that detract from the beautiful view.</td>', 'The sky is the brightest part of the image and so that is where my eye goes first. In contrast the grass and trees are very dark. To me this image has significant exposure issues that detract from the beautiful view.', '2006-03-29 12:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269847, 312136, 53095, '<td valign="top">Too noisey.</td>', 'Too noisey.', '2006-03-29 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269852, 310870, 53095, '<td valign="top">Looks like too much dead space at the bottom to me.</td>', 'Looks like too much dead space at the bottom to me.', '2006-03-29 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269856, 309388, 53095, '<td valign="top">The sky looks too bright compared to water/bridge, could use some dodging.</td>', 'The sky looks too bright compared to water/bridge, could use some dodging.', '2006-03-29 12:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269862, 310584, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the close-up and the stop-motion of the water is good. The lighting and tone could do with some work, though. I appreciate and understand the use of blue in the toning but it seems a little flat. Something more subtle may have worked better, such as adding some blue to the neutrals/whites or adjusting the blue in curves. With this type of close-up a lot of the emphasis is on the eyes and the eyes here look a little dark, esp the one on the right with no catchlight at all.</td>', 'I like the close-up and the stop-motion of the water is good. The lighting and tone could do with some work, though. I appreciate and understand the use of blue in the toning but it seems a little flat. Something more subtle may have worked better, such as adding some blue to the neutrals/whites or adjusting the blue in curves. With this type of close-up a lot of the emphasis is on the eyes and the eyes here look a little dark, esp the one on the right with no catchlight at all.', '2006-03-29 12:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269889, 311567, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very bright and colorful, although could have done with being a little more sharper. Not so sure about the thick white line around the bigger droplet either.</td>', 'Very bright and colorful, although could have done with being a little more sharper. Not so sure about the thick white line around the bigger droplet either.', '2006-03-29 12:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269891, 310659, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the monochromatic tone of the image. It seems very peaceful and tranquil. A very soft flowing photograph.</td>', 'I like the monochromatic tone of the image. It seems very peaceful and tranquil. A very soft flowing photograph.', '2006-03-29 12:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269894, 311777, 40355, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture.  The lighting is dramatic and colors intense.  Great shot - 10</td>', 'Amazing capture.  The lighting is dramatic and colors intense.  Great shot - 10', '2006-03-29 12:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269896, 311832, 40355, '<td valign="top">Wonderful IR shot.  I''m always amazed by the intensity.  10</td>', 'Wonderful IR shot.  I''m always amazed by the intensity.  10', '2006-03-29 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269902, 311808, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very original concept and I like the composition. The lighting and visual appeal is lacking, however, and is what lets the image down. This type of image is more appealing when it''s brighter, more colorful, and ''cleaner''. The water droplets on the counter, the dullness to the chrome, and the ''corosion'' to the spout makes it more ''real'' but less appealing.</td>', 'Very original concept and I like the composition. The lighting and visual appeal is lacking, however, and is what lets the image down. This type of image is more appealing when it''s brighter, more colorful, and ''cleaner''. The water droplets on the counter, the dullness to the chrome, and the ''corosion'' to the spout makes it more ''real'' but less appealing.', '2006-03-29 12:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269907, 310037, 29949, '<td valign="top">What'' this?!?!?!</td>', 'What'' this?!?!?!', '2006-03-29 12:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2269908, 311174, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good color contrasts and clarity. A bright appealing image.</td>', 'Good color contrasts and clarity. A bright appealing image.', '2006-03-29 12:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
