(2270839, 312034, 56061, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2006-03-29 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270900, 311387, 6008, '<td valign="top">The image itself isnt bad but the composition seems to follow the basic stance of put everything in the middle. Because of that I am going to assume you''re a beginner. The rule of thirds isnt a hard fast rule but for most situations it dramatically improves the composition, and I think this situation would benefit from it. The horizon line is almost exactly in the middle, effectively cutting the image in half. If you split the image into thirds and put the horizon on either the lower or upper third it would help. In this case since the water has more detail than the sky putting the horizon on the upper third would be better. Similiarly splitting the image vertically into thirds and putting the line created by the sun on the third it would make the image more appealing to the eye.</td>', 'The image itself isnt bad but the composition seems to follow the basic stance of put everything in the middle. Because of that I am going to assume you''re a beginner. The rule of thirds isnt a hard fast rule but for most situations it dramatically improves the composition, and I think this situation would benefit from it. The horizon line is almost exactly in the middle, effectively cutting the image in half. If you split the image into thirds and put the horizon on either the lower or upper third it would help. In this case since the water has more detail than the sky putting the horizon on the upper third would be better. Similiarly splitting the image vertically into thirds and putting the line created by the sun on the third it would make the image more appealing to the eye.', '2006-03-29 17:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270904, 311376, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tilt angle/perspective works on some images but I dont think it really works here, although I can see why you maybe did it to get the diagonal lines running through it. The dodge/burn (or similar) also seems to be slightly overdone, especially in the sky since there is an overexposed streak that runs through it. The subject is fairly unappealing to me and I feel like it needs another something to make it more interesting.</td>', 'The tilt angle/perspective works on some images but I dont think it really works here, although I can see why you maybe did it to get the diagonal lines running through it. The dodge/burn (or similar) also seems to be slightly overdone, especially in the sky since there is an overexposed streak that runs through it. The subject is fairly unappealing to me and I feel like it needs another something to make it more interesting.', '2006-03-29 17:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270910, 312217, 54838, '<td valign="top">Would be nicer if it were brighter.</td>', 'Would be nicer if it were brighter.', '2006-03-29 17:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270912, 309388, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s likely just the perspective of the bridge but it makes the image look unstraight - I feel my head tilting to straighten up the line of the bridge. Of course straightening up the bridge makes the horizon uneven so I think maybe a different angle of the bridge may have been better.</td>', 'It''s likely just the perspective of the bridge but it makes the image look unstraight - I feel my head tilting to straighten up the line of the bridge. Of course straightening up the bridge makes the horizon uneven so I think maybe a different angle of the bridge may have been better.', '2006-03-29 17:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270915, 310811, 54838, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this more if less of the faucet were in the picture.</td>', 'I would have liked this more if less of the faucet were in the picture.', '2006-03-29 17:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270917, 312238, 54838, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but the water plays such a small role.</td>', 'Nice picture, but the water plays such a small role.', '2006-03-29 17:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270918, 312173, 6008, '<td valign="top">The colors and lighting look a little dull on my monitor, perhaps a level or curves adjustment could bring them up a little more. I also find the water drops on the glass fairly distracting since they dont really add anything to the composition.</td>', 'The colors and lighting look a little dull on my monitor, perhaps a level or curves adjustment could bring them up a little more. I also find the water drops on the glass fairly distracting since they dont really add anything to the composition.', '2006-03-29 17:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270922, 311776, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like this - it is very light and ethereal in its abstractness. The bubbles at the bottom almost remind me of braille lettering for some reason.</td>', 'I like this - it is very light and ethereal in its abstractness. The bubbles at the bottom almost remind me of braille lettering for some reason.', '2006-03-29 17:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270924, 310817, 54838, '<td valign="top">Too much digital sharpening.</td>', 'Too much digital sharpening.', '2006-03-29 17:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270930, 311798, 6008, '<td valign="top">The texture under the drop is good and I like the color of the green, but I find the highlights a little distracting.</td>', 'The texture under the drop is good and I like the color of the green, but I find the highlights a little distracting.', '2006-03-29 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270942, 311880, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very cute, and you''ve captured the impression/expressions perfectly.</td>', 'Very cute, and you''ve captured the impression/expressions perfectly.', '2006-03-29 17:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270952, 311373, 6008, '<td valign="top">Very nice complimentary colors and the lighting makes it a nice clean shot. Good clarity on the water droplets also.</td>', 'Very nice complimentary colors and the lighting makes it a nice clean shot. Good clarity on the water droplets also.', '2006-03-29 17:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270982, 311572, 54838, '<td valign="top">I love the lights.</td>', 'I love the lights.', '2006-03-29 17:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2270993, 312078, 54838, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and abstract art.  A little scary.  Very nice!</td>', 'Very interesting and abstract art.  A little scary.  Very nice!', '2006-03-29 17:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271000, 310060, 54838, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  If only it were real...<br/>I would have given a 10 except the stars seem too uniform and fake.</td>', 'Beautiful!  If only it were real...I would have given a 10 except the stars seem too uniform and fake.', '2006-03-29 17:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271020, 311716, 43869, '<td valign="top">I can''t vote, but this is excellent!  I like the way the background shows up in the droplets- makes it look plaid.  Very nice!</td>', 'I can''t vote, but this is excellent!  I like the way the background shows up in the droplets- makes it look plaid.  Very nice!', '2006-03-29 17:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271071, 311921, 39663, '<td valign="top">absolutely wicked</td>', 'absolutely wicked', '2006-03-29 17:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271141, 311940, 49652, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - the colors are terrific.</td>', 'Beautiful - the colors are terrific.', '2006-03-29 18:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271235, 312247, 19982, '<td valign="top">Love the perfectly still water and the symetrical reflection.  The leading line up to the smokestack is perfect.  :-)</td>', 'Love the perfectly still water and the symetrical reflection.  The leading line up to the smokestack is perfect.  :-)', '2006-03-29 18:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271246, 311046, 19982, '<td valign="top">The addition of the human element totally makes this picture.  Without him standing there, I couldn''t tell if this was 3 inches tall, or 3 feet tall.  Now I see it''s huge.  Awesome shot!  Love the lighting.</td>', 'The addition of the human element totally makes this picture.  Without him standing there, I couldn''t tell if this was 3 inches tall, or 3 feet tall.  Now I see it''s huge.  Awesome shot!  Love the lighting.', '2006-03-29 18:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271259, 311724, 4767, '<td valign="top">excellent d.o.f. - nice photo</td>', 'excellent d.o.f. - nice photo', '2006-03-29 18:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271285, 311843, 20075, '<td valign="top">The idea of one bottle pouring into the other (even by reflection, as it seems to be here) has a certain appeal, but I think the flame is distracting.  It''s not clear to me what you intended the flame to contribute to this photo.  Perhaps you just needed a light source... ?</td>', 'The idea of one bottle pouring into the other (even by reflection, as it seems to be here) has a certain appeal, but I think the flame is distracting.  It''s not clear to me what you intended the flame to contribute to this photo.  Perhaps you just needed a light source... ?', '2006-03-29 19:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271297, 311798, 56206, '<td valign="top">I love this photo.  Something about it captures my eye and holds it there.  It''s awesome.</td>', 'I love this photo.  Something about it captures my eye and holds it there.  It''s awesome.', '2006-03-29 19:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271299, 312238, 20075, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  I think it would look even better with a filter to enhance the blue and green.  However, although the photo contains water, I see the oak tree as the subject and don''t really notice the water much.  But again, it''s a nice photo, and nicely composed.</td>', 'Nice photo.  I think it would look even better with a filter to enhance the blue and green.  However, although the photo contains water, I see the oak tree as the subject and don''t really notice the water much.  But again, it''s a nice photo, and nicely composed.', '2006-03-29 19:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271303, 312136, 20075, '<td valign="top">Fantastic close up of a bird in flight!  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Fantastic close up of a bird in flight!  Nicely composed.', '2006-03-29 19:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271313, 311895, 20075, '<td valign="top">I like your sense of humor. :)</td>', 'I like your sense of humor. :)', '2006-03-29 19:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271321, 310485, 327, '<td valign="top">Awesome movement. Nice shot, maybe something you should try and continue with. Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome movement. Nice shot, maybe something you should try and continue with. Very nice.', '2006-03-29 19:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271499, 310975, 48717, '<td valign="top">If the lighting were more even, this would have done much better.  The Light on the right is perfect, but it is a bit harsh coming from the left.</td>', 'If the lighting were more even, this would have done much better.  The Light on the right is perfect, but it is a bit harsh coming from the left.', '2006-03-29 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271576, 312095, 43565, '<td valign="top">Yes, but a little too far out of the box for me.</td>', 'Yes, but a little too far out of the box for me.', '2006-03-29 20:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271608, 311809, 20075, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition.  I only wish it wasn''t so blurry...</td>', 'Really nice composition.  I only wish it wasn''t so blurry...', '2006-03-29 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271799, 312084, 48717, '<td valign="top">There is not much along the lines of visual intrest, but you have captured a very nice motion freeze and you have well rendered tones.</td>', 'There is not much along the lines of visual intrest, but you have captured a very nice motion freeze and you have well rendered tones.', '2006-03-29 22:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
