(2271895, 310087, 48717, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-03-29 23:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2271897, 310471, 48717, '<td valign="top">Can I go?  This is one of the nicer vacation spot type pictures I have seen, nice visual stimulation.  Nice color and composition.</td>', 'Can I go?  This is one of the nicer vacation spot type pictures I have seen, nice visual stimulation.  Nice color and composition.', '2006-03-29 23:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272023, 312035, 37749, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel refreshed</td>', 'Makes me feel refreshed', '2006-03-30 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272076, 311914, 19311, '<td valign="top">I would like this better vertical and if the highligts weren''t blown out on the left.  Other than that this is a great shot.</td>', 'I would like this better vertical and if the highligts weren''t blown out on the left.  Other than that this is a great shot.', '2006-03-30 00:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272118, 312094, 4767, '<td valign="top">image is rather small.</td>', 'image is rather small.', '2006-03-30 01:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272161, 311570, 4767, '<td valign="top">Looks like some LARGE Koi there!  Aren''t they fun to shoot?</td>', 'Looks like some LARGE Koi there!  Aren''t they fun to shoot?', '2006-03-30 01:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272166, 312078, 4767, '<td valign="top">Title alone is worth at least an 8!</td>', 'Title alone is worth at least an 8!', '2006-03-30 01:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272191, 311803, 4767, '<td valign="top">very beautiful and so GREEN!  Nice extended depth  of field.  Has a nice feeling of the Northwest.  (No watch it be Maine or some such!)</td>', 'very beautiful and so GREEN!  Nice extended depth  of field.  Has a nice feeling of the Northwest.  (No watch it be Maine or some such!)', '2006-03-30 01:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272219, 311629, 4767, '<td valign="top">Strangely evocative of jjbeguin''s _Water Colors_. I would guess the same title and similar subject matter is an homage to M. Beguin.  (I would also guess you considered this as an entry in the _déjà vu_ challenge.  My third guess is that it would have done well there as well.  Bravo for the sincere flattery of the finest photographer at dpc.  It ain''t bequin, but it ain''t half bad! 8</td>', 'Strangely evocative of jjbeguin''s _Water Colors_. I would guess the same title and similar subject matter is an homage to M. Beguin.  (I would also guess you considered this as an entry in the _déjà vu_ challenge.  My third guess is that it would have done well there as well.  Bravo for the sincere flattery of the finest photographer at dpc.  It ain''t bequin, but it ain''t half bad! 8', '2006-03-30 01:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272429, 312069, 41337, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2006-03-30 03:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272460, 311563, 48717, '<td valign="top">Good B &amp; W, really nice tones, but the top seems a little blown out.</td>', 'Good B & W, really nice tones, but the top seems a little blown out.', '2006-03-30 03:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272461, 311528, 48717, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones, dof and lighting.</td>', 'Very nice tones, dof and lighting.', '2006-03-30 03:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272462, 311888, 48717, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the pure white of the goose and the murky water.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the pure white of the goose and the murky water.', '2006-03-30 04:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272478, 312108, 50441, '<td valign="top">Wow.... fantastic.</td>', 'Wow.... fantastic.', '2006-03-30 04:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272620, 310060, 53571, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.', '2006-03-30 07:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272621, 312030, 53571, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot would be more interesting if you had closly cropped on her mouth and nose.</td>', 'To me, this shot would be more interesting if you had closly cropped on her mouth and nose.', '2006-03-30 07:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272622, 311944, 53571, '<td valign="top">Very nice light. This is a keeper</td>', 'Very nice light. This is a keeper', '2006-03-30 07:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272624, 311299, 53571, '<td valign="top">To me, this shot is too dark and too purple to be rated higher than average.</td>', 'To me, this shot is too dark and too purple to be rated higher than average.', '2006-03-30 07:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272626, 311960, 53571, '<td valign="top">For my tastes, this shot need a little work. Namely, I feel that the image is overexposed about a full stop (see the hot spots in the water). Water can be tough on a sunny/bright day.</td>', 'For my tastes, this shot need a little work. Namely, I feel that the image is overexposed about a full stop (see the hot spots in the water). Water can be tough on a sunny/bright day.', '2006-03-30 07:25:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272627, 311974, 53571, '<td valign="top">This is a nice moment. The reflection make it above average.</td>', 'This is a nice moment. The reflection make it above average.', '2006-03-30 07:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272629, 311835, 53571, '<td valign="top">This is a nice moment. I can''t decided if I would like to see this more closely composed/cropped.</td>', 'This is a nice moment. I can''t decided if I would like to see this more closely composed/cropped.', '2006-03-30 07:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272630, 312150, 53571, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. This is above average to me. I assume a flash was used. It is tricky to create this moment and keep the exposure correct. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice job. This is above average to me. I assume a flash was used. It is tricky to create this moment and keep the exposure correct. Nice work.', '2006-03-30 07:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272631, 310401, 53571, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph. I rated this image lower then another shot that is similar due in large part to an exposure issue I see with the water coming from the mouth (hot spots). Still an above average shot. Good job.</td>', 'I like this photograph. I rated this image lower then another shot that is similar due in large part to an exposure issue I see with the water coming from the mouth (hot spots). Still an above average shot. Good job.', '2006-03-30 07:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272632, 311648, 53571, '<td valign="top">I would like this photograph more with more careful exposure. I feel like the exposure might be 1/2 over.</td>', 'I would like this photograph more with more careful exposure. I feel like the exposure might be 1/2 over.', '2006-03-30 07:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272635, 311563, 53571, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for falling water. This shot is nice. However, the drop itself needs to be sharper. Maybe the use of a fill flash would help? Higher shutter speed in general? Still, this is a nice moment that is difficult to capture.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for falling water. This shot is nice. However, the drop itself needs to be sharper. Maybe the use of a fill flash would help? Higher shutter speed in general? Still, this is a nice moment that is difficult to capture.', '2006-03-30 07:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272638, 310613, 53571, '<td valign="top">The extreme depth of field is interesting. I understand your motives. I''m not sure you got what you wanted. I feel like I want to see the spider closer. Nice effort.</td>', 'The extreme depth of field is interesting. I understand your motives. I''m not sure you got what you wanted. I feel like I want to see the spider closer. Nice effort.', '2006-03-30 07:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272671, 311989, 19982, '<td valign="top">Lovely and unique.  I''m sure they''ll love it!  :-)</td>', 'Lovely and unique.  I''m sure they''ll love it!  :-)', '2006-03-30 07:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272695, 312068, 38032, '<td valign="top">Another water fall .... I gotta say this is pretty close to perfect.  The gentle soft lip of the fall all the way to the sharp angle spray at the floor --  The contrast of the water to the shadows  -just superb.  The balance here is very appealling as well as the general composition.   I''m gonna guess this makes the top 3.  Very nice job.  9 and fave.</td>', 'Another water fall .... I gotta say this is pretty close to perfect.  The gentle soft lip of the fall all the way to the sharp angle spray at the floor --  The contrast of the water to the shadows  -just superb.  The balance here is very appealling as well as the general composition.   I''m gonna guess this makes the top 3.  Very nice job.  9 and fave.', '2006-03-30 08:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272700, 311647, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is definitely intriguing! ... nice work.</td>', 'this is definitely intriguing! ... nice work.', '2006-03-30 08:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272703, 311530, 38032, '<td valign="top">Great abstractions going on here in the water very nice composition.</td>', 'Great abstractions going on here in the water very nice composition.', '2006-03-30 08:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272715, 311978, 38032, '<td valign="top">clever and original in MY brain  ... the thumbnail says it all ... I think once we get this close it needs just a bit more clarity or something but it is quite special anyway.  7</td>', 'clever and original in MY brain  ... the thumbnail says it all ... I think once we get this close it needs just a bit more clarity or something but it is quite special anyway.  7', '2006-03-30 08:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272719, 311656, 38032, '<td valign="top">very nice feeling here. 7</td>', 'very nice feeling here. 7', '2006-03-30 08:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272722, 312146, 38032, '<td valign="top">great feeling of movement and .... emergence (perfect title).  Even a bit of personification makes it touching.</td>', 'great feeling of movement and .... emergence (perfect title).  Even a bit of personification makes it touching.', '2006-03-30 08:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272724, 310485, 38032, '<td valign="top">Cool effect .... flash then open shutter?  Nice ... I don''t see much of this treatment but I definitely like it.</td>', 'Cool effect .... flash then open shutter?  Nice ... I don''t see much of this treatment but I definitely like it.', '2006-03-30 08:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272733, 311046, 38032, '<td valign="top">I like how the light is working here.  The contrast is great and the combination of textures is superb.  Looks just a tad set up but I think the title sort of makes up for that a little.  I''m putting this as a 9 due to the wonderfully excessive use of water :) ...</td>', 'I like how the light is working here.  The contrast is great and the combination of textures is superb.  Looks just a tad set up but I think the title sort of makes up for that a little.  I''m putting this as a 9 due to the wonderfully excessive use of water :) ...', '2006-03-30 08:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272735, 310901, 38032, '<td valign="top">familiar looking.</td>', 'familiar looking.', '2006-03-30 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272737, 310423, 38032, '<td valign="top">WOW! -- amazing image!</td>', 'WOW! -- amazing image!', '2006-03-30 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272882, 310477, 36606, '<td valign="top">very cool shot! (8)</td>', 'very cool shot! (8)', '2006-03-30 09:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2272885, 311564, 36606, '<td valign="top">WOW! this is fantastic! love the power i can feel here. Also great skys too (9)</td>', 'WOW! this is fantastic! love the power i can feel here. Also great skys too (9)', '2006-03-30 09:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
