(2274190, 311777, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good capture.  A variation in composition (depending what you had of course), especially including more of the top, to create more overall balance, make this even better in my opinion.  The tanker in the rear, whilst fairly minor, takes a <i>little</i> away from the somewhat ''otherworldly'' scene, in my opinion.</td>', '7 - Good capture.  A variation in composition (depending what you had of course), especially including more of the top, to create more overall balance, make this even better in my opinion.  The tanker in the rear, whilst fairly minor, takes a little away from the somewhat ''otherworldly'' scene, in my opinion.', '2006-03-30 19:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274200, 310060, 39850, '<td valign="top">6 - Ah, whilst I realize this size likely doesn''t do this justice, especially the long exposure, just wish it had more detail.  Looks like a unique shot, what I can discern.  Possibly also a nudge rotation up on the right - but not sure (apologies in advance if wrong).</td>', '6 - Ah, whilst I realize this size likely doesn''t do this justice, especially the long exposure, just wish it had more detail.  Looks like a unique shot, what I can discern.  Possibly also a nudge rotation up on the right - but not sure (apologies in advance if wrong).', '2006-03-30 19:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274274, 311299, 52336, '<td valign="top">Adequate for the challenge, but not enough detail to hold interest.  Noticeable jpeg artefacting around the edges of the glass detracts from the whole.</td>', 'Adequate for the challenge, but not enough detail to hold interest.  Noticeable jpeg artefacting around the edges of the glass detracts from the whole.', '2006-03-30 19:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
