(2274301, 311818, 40370, '<td valign="top">Interesting, the flowing water looks painted, I like the shine on the two small rocks mid right.</td>', 'Interesting, the flowing water looks painted, I like the shine on the two small rocks mid right.', '2006-03-30 20:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274310, 310101, 40370, '<td valign="top">Whose hogging all the sunsets? Stunning once more. I know, maybe there are sections of the world that are still suck in winter "drab"  because you are sucking all the color to your spot. Good luck. <br/> <br/>Oh and I love the line of cattail-like plant life on the right horizon. The beautiful stocks just continue around the lake I suppose.</td>', 'Whose hogging all the sunsets? Stunning once more. I know, maybe there are sections of the world that are still suck in winter "drab"  because you are sucking all the color to your spot. Good luck.  Oh and I love the line of cattail-like plant life on the right horizon. The beautiful stocks just continue around the lake I suppose.', '2006-03-30 20:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274311, 311346, 52336, '<td valign="top">What a great picture.  Love the choice of duotone, and the varying texture and shapes.</td>', 'What a great picture.  Love the choice of duotone, and the varying texture and shapes.', '2006-03-30 20:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274313, 311576, 40370, '<td valign="top">Most interesting, I hope for the residents of this house that this is an illusion.</td>', 'Most interesting, I hope for the residents of this house that this is an illusion.', '2006-03-30 20:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274318, 312112, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, composition, sharpness.  Feels just a little too over-processed / over-sharpened, over-blue - more color contrast from bird to water would help.</td>', 'Nice capture, composition, sharpness.  Feels just a little too over-processed / over-sharpened, over-blue - more color contrast from bird to water would help.', '2006-03-30 20:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274322, 310854, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, colors.  Most viewers including myself would prefer straighter masts.  To keep sun in frame, try portrait mode with your ultra-wide, keep camera horizontal so that the masts remain vertical, and crop off bottom of frame.</td>', 'Nice composition, colors.  Most viewers including myself would prefer straighter masts.  To keep sun in frame, try portrait mode with your ultra-wide, keep camera horizontal so that the masts remain vertical, and crop off bottom of frame.', '2006-03-30 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2274326, 311647, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, colors, effect of stop action.  Wish I could see more of the person.</td>', 'Nice capture, colors, effect of stop action.  Wish I could see more of the person.', '2006-03-30 20:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
