(2275966, 311564, 32885, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I like the turbulence of the sea and the sky compared to the tranquility of the ice. This composition is great. Well done.</td>', 'Nice photo. I like the turbulence of the sea and the sky compared to the tranquility of the ice. This composition is great. Well done.', '2006-03-31 08:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
