(2276458, 312139, 31443, '<td valign="top">Intriguing! Looking forward to seeing what this is, love the colors and the feela of softness..</td>', 'Intriguing! Looking forward to seeing what this is, love the colors and the feela of softness..', '2006-03-31 13:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276468, 309334, 40912, '<td valign="top">While this is a pretty neat catch, a few things throw it off for me. I realize it''s either underwater or through glass, but there are lots of spots under the board and in the water. The reflection is a little distracting.. maybe if it had been taken a few secs before, while she was totally underwater? :)</td>', 'While this is a pretty neat catch, a few things throw it off for me. I realize it''s either underwater or through glass, but there are lots of spots under the board and in the water. The reflection is a little distracting.. maybe if it had been taken a few secs before, while she was totally underwater? :)', '2006-03-31 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276472, 310062, 31443, '<td valign="top">Delightful and delicious :)</td>', 'Delightful and delicious :)', '2006-03-31 13:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276477, 312103, 40912, '<td valign="top">While the clarity of the water before the fall is very nice and clear, the rest of the water seems extremely OOF. The rocks above are nice, clear, and add a nice texture. If the image was a little larger, it would probably be easier to see details. Good luck! :)</td>', 'While the clarity of the water before the fall is very nice and clear, the rest of the water seems extremely OOF. The rocks above are nice, clear, and add a nice texture. If the image was a little larger, it would probably be easier to see details. Good luck! :)', '2006-03-31 13:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276495, 311861, 40912, '<td valign="top">Hmm... the dark line above the feet makes the tub look dirty.. and the faucet above is just enough in the shot that it''s distracting.<br/>Interesting angle.. don''t see that much, hehe.<br/> <br/>..oh, and your left pinky toe has a lil dirt spot on it.. lol :D</td>', 'Hmm... the dark line above the feet makes the tub look dirty.. and the faucet above is just enough in the shot that it''s distracting.Interesting angle.. don''t see that much, hehe. ..oh, and your left pinky toe has a lil dirt spot on it.. lol :D', '2006-03-31 13:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276521, 311343, 40912, '<td valign="top">If the apple was more in focus, this would be an awesome shot. :) Also, the top of the apple is blown out - can''t see any detail in the white.</td>', 'If the apple was more in focus, this would be an awesome shot. :) Also, the top of the apple is blown out - can''t see any detail in the white.', '2006-03-31 14:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276548, 311944, 5112, '<td valign="top">Really beautiful - so peaceful, and yet it looks like the leaf is going to drop off the edge, and that''s scary.  ~10</td>', 'Really beautiful - so peaceful, and yet it looks like the leaf is going to drop off the edge, and that''s scary.  ~10', '2006-03-31 14:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276567, 312094, 40912, '<td valign="top">Several things caused me to vote low on this image. First, it''s far too small to see any detail. Second, I realize it''s "x-ray", but the thing is... water''s the only detail. All the rest is just totally blown out.</td>', 'Several things caused me to vote low on this image. First, it''s far too small to see any detail. Second, I realize it''s "x-ray", but the thing is... water''s the only detail. All the rest is just totally blown out.', '2006-03-31 14:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276568, 311564, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Now that''s a dynamic image.  (10)</td>', 'Wow!  Now that''s a dynamic image.  (10)', '2006-03-31 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276577, 312078, 5112, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Love it.  The title is just right, man, I love this.</td>', 'Funny!  Love it.  The title is just right, man, I love this.', '2006-03-31 14:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2276582, 311530, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.  I wonder if getting a bit closer would make it more dynamic.</td>', 'Nice angle.  I wonder if getting a bit closer would make it more dynamic.', '2006-03-31 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
