(2276594, 312140, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful idea.  Love the stopped motion of all the water drops.  I think that the picture would be even better if the kids were smiling or showing that they''re enjoying themselves.</td>', 'Beautiful idea.  Love the stopped motion of all the water drops.  I think that the picture would be even better if the kids were smiling or showing that they''re enjoying themselves.', '2006-03-31 14:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
