(2278123, 311985, 35602, '<td valign="top">Good macro attempt, but focus is a bit soft.  I have discovered that when I am in macro mode or close-up, I can actually get better focus by moving me and my camera  closer or farther from the subject.  I can''t focus through lenses, so the body movement acts as a focusing technique.</td>', 'Good macro attempt, but focus is a bit soft.  I have discovered that when I am in macro mode or close-up, I can actually get better focus by moving me and my camera  closer or farther from the subject.  I can''t focus through lenses, so the body movement acts as a focusing technique.', '2006-04-01 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
