(2283418, 310101, 7322, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your first blue, Robert. This was one of my favorites. The movement of the grasses gives adds another element to what would otherwise appear a perfectly serene image---it makes one realize that those clouds reflected in the water may have blown over in a few minutes or even a few seconds, capturing the feeling of how fleeting a beautiful sunrise can be.</td>', 'Congratulations on your first blue, Robert. This was one of my favorites. The movement of the grasses gives adds another element to what would otherwise appear a perfectly serene image---it makes one realize that those clouds reflected in the water may have blown over in a few minutes or even a few seconds, capturing the feeling of how fleeting a beautiful sunrise can be.', '2006-04-03 12:06:15.000000', NULL, 0),
