(2283708, 311946, 30861, '<td valign="top">I just now realized this was yours, Harvey. It was one of my high-scorers. I think it''s a very powerful image, made even more so by the matter-of-fact rendering of it, by the way you chose not to use contrast enhancement and dodge/burn to "pump it up". It''s a fine example of the basic philosophy you espouse often in your posts :-)</td>', 'I just now realized this was yours, Harvey. It was one of my high-scorers. I think it''s a very powerful image, made even more so by the matter-of-fact rendering of it, by the way you chose not to use contrast enhancement and dodge/burn to "pump it up". It''s a fine example of the basic philosophy you espouse often in your posts :-)', '2006-04-03 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
