(2284437, 312080, 1031, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by mosall:</b></div><hr/><i> Overall I love this photograph. I feel the lower 1/3 of the photo is distracting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, this seems to have been a common feeling about this shot. After it was submitted, I tried desaturating the only the foreground to try and emphasize/focus on the water on the edge of the rocks.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=316071" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/316071.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/316071.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/316071.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by mosall: Overall I love this photograph. I feel the lower 1/3 of the photo is distracting.  Yes, this seems to have been a common feeling about this shot. After it was submitted, I tried desaturating the only the foreground to try and emphasize/focus on the water on the edge of the rocks. ', '2006-04-03 18:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
