(2284838, 312075, 13688, '<td valign="top">For those interested...<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=316177" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/316177.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/316177.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/13688/thumb/316177.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>clone duck<br/>curves masking sky for separate adjustment<br/>dodge boat, building &amp; tree hangings<br/>burn sky<br/>desat, duotone, sepia<br/>shadow/highlight adjustment<br/>more dodging trees and lake reflection<br/>contrast boost<br/>sharpen edges with selective tree masking<br/>more selective sharpening on boat, reflections, and building<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-03 20:01:35.</i></td>', 'For those interested...  clone duckcurves masking sky for separate adjustmentdodge boat, building & tree hangingsburn skydesat, duotone, sepiashadow/highlight adjustmentmore dodging trees and lake reflectioncontrast boostsharpen edges with selective tree maskingmore selective sharpening on boat, reflections, and building', '2006-04-03 21:00:33.000000', '2006-04-03 21:01:35.000000', 0),
