(2285936, 310101, 50034, '<td valign="top">Obviously, I am in the presence of a Master Photographer!  Thank you for the privilege of learning from the Best.<br/>Your photo (as described by many &amp; the rating) is Amazing!  I''m sure that the moment you captured this vista must have been equally amazing.<br/>   The LORD is kind in that way.  He gives us a one-of-a-kind original painting every evening, then takes pride in His highest creation enhancing His daily painting with unique personality!  <br/>Allow me to add my own 10, after the fact.   Wow!!!!!!!  SCH<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-04-04 09:19:38.</i></td>', 'Obviously, I am in the presence of a Master Photographer!  Thank you for the privilege of learning from the Best.Your photo (as described by many & the rating) is Amazing!  I''m sure that the moment you captured this vista must have been equally amazing.   The LORD is kind in that way.  He gives us a one-of-a-kind original painting every evening, then takes pride in His highest creation enhancing His daily painting with unique personality!  Allow me to add my own 10, after the fact.   Wow!!!!!!!  SCH', '2006-04-04 10:19:01.000000', '2006-04-04 10:19:38.000000', 0),
(2285956, 311815, 42792, '<td valign="top">This sure got my attention.  Congratulations on a very respectable finish!  And almost like Bear''s blue, you seem to have chalked up an impressive lack of low votes.  That really says something.  Well done.</td>', 'This sure got my attention.  Congratulations on a very respectable finish!  And almost like Bear''s blue, you seem to have chalked up an impressive lack of low votes.  That really says something.  Well done.', '2006-04-04 10:32:52.000000', NULL, 0),
