(2286217, 311229, 28710, '<td valign="top">It looks good, but not great, it''s true. Things I don''t like are very few, and hard to pin down.<br/> <br/>The only real suggestion here that I might have is to move down a bit closer to the water to suck up some of that negative space in the middle and trim the sky down, while allowing the foreground to occupy a greater space.</td>', 'It looks good, but not great, it''s true. Things I don''t like are very few, and hard to pin down. The only real suggestion here that I might have is to move down a bit closer to the water to suck up some of that negative space in the middle and trim the sky down, while allowing the foreground to occupy a greater space.', '2006-04-04 12:37:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2286255, 310101, 39349, '<td valign="top">Congrats Bear, <br/> <br/>I guess this would be considered an ''estuary''? haha! This is a marvelous photo that is totally deserving of top honors, and is an inspirational masterpiece that gives me hope of someday capturing its equal.<br/> <br/>My hats off to you.<br/> <br/>Best regards,<br/>Steve (naldslc)<br/></td>', 'Congrats Bear,  I guess this would be considered an ''estuary''? haha! This is a marvelous photo that is totally deserving of top honors, and is an inspirational masterpiece that gives me hope of someday capturing its equal. My hats off to you. Best regards,Steve (naldslc)', '2006-04-04 12:55:52.000000', NULL, 0);
