(2288733, 310101, 48560, '<td valign="top">you know bear, i keep coming back to this winning photo of yours - not a norm for me (in the exception of JJBeguin''s self-potrait). I was thinking of something for the Textures IV challenge and was thinking - this "Flood Tide &amp; Cattails  Sunset" could have been a hell lot better looking if allowed the 720pixels and 200kb requirements.<br/> <br/>Congrats once again on this wonderful photo and the ribbon - Just goes to prove yet again how good you are with landscapes (I''m jealous!)<br/> <br/>cheers</td>', 'you know bear, i keep coming back to this winning photo of yours - not a norm for me (in the exception of JJBeguin''s self-potrait). I was thinking of something for the Textures IV challenge and was thinking - this "Flood Tide & Cattails  Sunset" could have been a hell lot better looking if allowed the 720pixels and 200kb requirements. Congrats once again on this wonderful photo and the ribbon - Just goes to prove yet again how good you are with landscapes (I''m jealous!) cheers', '2006-04-05 06:28:05.000000', NULL, 0),
