(2290576, 310101, 40370, '<td valign="top">I do not make much of a presence on this website but first and foremost I loved your Water II entry and am thrilled you won a blue ribbon. Secondly, I just had to make a post challenge comment because otherwise I would be the only DPC''r left in the Northern Hemisphere who hadn''t. With greatest respect, congratulations.</td>', 'I do not make much of a presence on this website but first and foremost I loved your Water II entry and am thrilled you won a blue ribbon. Secondly, I just had to make a post challenge comment because otherwise I would be the only DPC''r left in the Northern Hemisphere who hadn''t. With greatest respect, congratulations.', '2006-04-05 21:20:12.000000', NULL, 0),
