(4315972, 312212, 87278, '<td valign="top">My interpretation: You can be calm and strong, yet vibrant and vigorous.<br/>Yeah, the guys are quite composed. I can''t help  saying ''calm in a storm''!<br/> <br/>Adding to my favs!</td>', 'My interpretation: You can be calm and strong, yet vibrant and vigorous.Yeah, the guys are quite composed. I can''t help  saying ''calm in a storm''! Adding to my favs!', '2007-12-15 13:08:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(4377627, 312075, 39427, '<td valign="top">man i''ve tried to take this photo from pretty much this exact spot many times and have never been successful.  It always comes out too ''busy'' with all the branches hanging and otherwise.  I think your editing really strengthened the composition and highlighted the most interesting elements of the frame, i will be making a mental note of this :)</td>', 'man i''ve tried to take this photo from pretty much this exact spot many times and have never been successful.  It always comes out too ''busy'' with all the branches hanging and otherwise.  I think your editing really strengthened the composition and highlighted the most interesting elements of the frame, i will be making a mental note of this :)', '2008-01-09 12:17:44.000000', NULL, 0),
