(4740920, 311564, 38509, '<td valign="top">ok. i''m ashamed not to comment on this masterpiece before ... but hey this is me :-)<br/>anyways ... <br/> <br/>composition: excellent, maybe if i can see more of the sea on the left side just to move ice and splashing wave little to the right, nonetheless fantastic<br/> <br/>light: excellent, i can only guess what postprocessing steps were taken but i guess i can recognize some "moves" considering the cloudy environment with few sky spots, the contrast between light and dark parts is perfect and details are okay considering dark mood of the photo<br/> <br/>everything else: excellent<br/> <br/>thats it.<br/> <br/>//<br/>g</td>', 'ok. i''m ashamed not to comment on this masterpiece before ... but hey this is me :-)anyways ...  composition: excellent, maybe if i can see more of the sea on the left side just to move ice and splashing wave little to the right, nonetheless fantastic light: excellent, i can only guess what postprocessing steps were taken but i guess i can recognize some "moves" considering the cloudy environment with few sky spots, the contrast between light and dark parts is perfect and details are okay considering dark mood of the photo everything else: excellent thats it. //g', '2008-06-02 05:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4830011, 310473, 47906, '<td valign="top">This is a nice attempt at this waterfall, you may want to try some selective color and sharpness/contrast to boost a bit of the color in the rocks and the greenery around. Another thing you may want to think about is investing in a ND filter. You can use it to keep the highlights above the falls to blowing out during the timed exposure. Nice attempt I hope it helps.</td>', 'This is a nice attempt at this waterfall, you may want to try some selective color and sharpness/contrast to boost a bit of the color in the rocks and the greenery around. Another thing you may want to think about is investing in a ND filter. You can use it to keep the highlights above the falls to blowing out during the timed exposure. Nice attempt I hope it helps.', '2008-07-16 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5131213, 311564, 69325, '<td valign="top">i need to check out your portfolio more often! this is just GORGEOUS! it must be frustrating to watch a 7 all week and not ribbon eh?</td>', 'i need to check out your portfolio more often! this is just GORGEOUS! it must be frustrating to watch a 7 all week and not ribbon eh?', '2008-12-15 00:13:31.000000', NULL, 0),
